# Local enforcement gate (the practical stand-in for branch protection, which
# is a paid feature on this plan — see docs/runbooks/SECURITY.md). Mirrors the
# CI lint+test jobs so broken code is caught before it reaches main. Build is
# left to CI + Vercel (a broken build fails the deploy, so prod stays on the
# last good one). E2E stays out (too slow for pre-push).
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm test
npm run docs:check
